[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0001","text":"舞蹈教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0002","text":"认识的舞者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0010","text":"真不错呢，好漂亮！\n是美琴酱准备的？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0020","text":"……不是\n只是稍微帮忙整理了一下流程"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0030","text":"没有没有，这不算什么！\n我们一起，做得非常开心呢～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0040","text":"美琴的话，就算当舞者\n也有实力站在最前线"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0050","text":"哈啊……哈啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0060","text":"——好，暂停一下！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0070","text":"……！\n哈…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0080","text":"绯田小姐不好意思──！\n就是刚才那段，想请你帮忙看一下──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0090","text":"──啊，那个，老师……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0100","text":"刚才那段……我跳得怎么样────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0110","text":"啊——…………\n嗯，没问题没问题！毕竟是刚开始嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0120","text":"……啊……好的…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0130","text":"……原来是这样！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0140","text":"对，那里\n不用勉强扭身体────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0150","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0160","text":"美琴小姐，辛苦了\n啊，那个……您饿不饿？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0170","text":"啊，那个，我……！\n有附近那家中餐馆的优惠券哦～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0007","text":"制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0180","text":"──如果觉得整天黏在一起才叫组合的话\n不如趁早解散比较好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0190","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_02_0200","text":"…………"}]
